24ef|n|The knave of trumps at gleek.	a:ykf,53,3~ykf,53,3	V:28in,77,1;1l4v,56,2;19y9,44,3;1tro,30,1~19y9,44,3;1l4v,56,2;1tro,30,1;28in,77,1	n:ykf,47,2;23fm,44,6;173c,15,5~23fm,44,6;173c,15,5;ykf,47,2	N:28in,105,7~28in,105,7
