24h0|n|An instrument such as a hammer, saw, plane, file, and the like, used in the manual arts, to facilitate mechanical operations; any instrument used by a craftsman or laborer at his work; an implement; as, the tools of a joiner, smith, shoe-maker, etc.; also, a cutter, chisel, or other part of an instrument or machine that dresses work. ; A machine for cutting or shaping materials; -- also called machine tool. ; Hence, any instrument of use or service. ; A weapon. ; A person used as an instrument by another person; -- a word of reproach; as, men of intrigue have their tools, by whose agency they accomplish their purposes.	a:1sk0,71,4;1m09,61,9;24zr,58,2;1yeo,56,2;5qt,49,3;19jb,47,4;nmd,47,7;f0n,41,3;mr6,40,1;289y,40,23;hsd,39,3;1f56,37,11;xk,35,5;tx6,23,6;wh3,22,6~289y,40,23;1dh9,13,12;1f56,37,11;w2z,2,9;1m09,61,9;nmd,47,7;1y56,13,7;7hn,13,7;tx6,23,6;wh3,22,6;xk,35,5;1s44,6,5;hnu,12,5;1sk0,71,4;19jb,47,4	v:h2d,73,2;hsd,53,8;ddj,33,3;1wxb,25,3;21t2,20,1~hsd,53,8;1wxb,25,3;ddj,33,3;h2d,73,2;21t2,20,1	V:2az,28,4;afm,26,5;c36,23,4~afm,26,5;2az,28,4;c36,23,4	n:h2d,79,3;1we5,62,3;ftf,61,6;24zr,58,2;jxc,55,4;1qya,51,5;19jb,50,5;a7g,48,9;f0q,36,6;ddj,33,3;21t2,30,2;1xwa,30,10;176t,28,14;jr4,26,9;f0n,25,1~176t,28,14;1xhj,25,11;1xwa,30,10;jr4,26,9;a7g,48,9;ftf,61,6;f0q,36,6;19jb,50,5;1qya,51,5;1f56,22,4;jxc,55,4;ddj,33,3;h2d,79,3;1we5,62,3;1ujw,16,3	N:c34,103,7;xrz,63,7;1i0u,52,4;bze,51,3;6ej,43,3;xr2,42,23;1i05,40,7;c2v,34,30;c35,27,6;1kmb,13,3;225l,11,1;1c7g,9,4;2az,8,1;1lqt,6,3;c36,3,1~c2v,34,30;xr2,42,23;1i05,40,7;xrz,63,7;c34,103,7;c35,27,6;1i0u,52,4;1c7g,9,4;1kmb,13,3;1lqt,6,3;6ej,43,3;bze,51,3;2b5j,2,2;225l,11,1;2az,8,1
